WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.920
Teams cannot manage what they do not know exists.

00:00:03.140 --> 00:00:06.020
AI supply chain risk management begins with inventory.

00:00:06.240 --> 00:00:17.360
Inventory should identify which models, datasets, packages, tools, prompts, APIs, services, and infrastructure components are used, who owns them, and how they are updated.

00:00:17.580 --> 00:00:26.700
Governance helps define review processes, ownership, approvals, acceptable use, exception handling, and documentation expectations.

00:00:26.920 --> 00:00:35.720
Monitoring helps teams detect unusual behavior, performance changes, dependency issues, unexpected access activity, and operational failures.

00:00:35.940 --> 00:00:38.180
Visibility makes improvement possible.
